vsm1.2:58.1:
The benefits are these. He practices in conformity with the dependence, because of the words
“The going forth by depending on the root of a tree as an abode” (Vin I 58, 96); it is a requisite
recommended by the Blessed One thus “Valueless, easy to get, and blameless” (A II 26);

vsm1.2:67.2:
he constantly sees the body’s true nature; he has a great sense of urgency; he abandons vanity of health,
etc.; he vanquishes fear and dread (MN 4); non-human beings respect and honour him;
he lives in conformity with the principles of fewness of wishes, and so on.
